ples of each : 5\n1. Fruits : ________________ ________________\n2. Vegetables : ________________ ________________\n3. Spices : ________________ ________________\n4. Beverages : ________________ ________________\n5. Pulses : ________________ ________________\nE. Match the following : 5\n1. Pucca houses a) Flat\n2. Kutcha houses b) Ancient house\n3. Slum c) Bricks and concrete\n4. Multi-Storey building d) Cluster of huts\n5. Haveli e) Mud\nF. Look at the following symbols and write their names : 5\nG. Answer the following questions : 10\n1. How would you help someone who has nose bleeding ?\n2. What are food grains ? explain it.\n3. What are different causes of water pollution ?\n4. What is cantilever bridge ?\n5. How men started making houses ?\n1.\n__________ 2.\n3.4.\n5.\n__________\n__________\n__________\n__________\n96EVS-4',1);
